{"id": 8330798432454, "title": "Momcozy Breast Milk Collector", "body_html": "<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-large bucket\" id=\"aplus\">\n<span class=\"a-list-item\">𝐏𝐚𝐬𝐬𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐂𝐨𝐥𝐥𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐇𝐢𝐠𝐡 𝐌𝐢𝐥𝐤 𝐒𝐮𝐩𝐩𝐥𝐲: Lightweight (0.18lb) yet spacious (3oz) for collecting more milk with fewer changes. Gently captures leakage and let-down without suction or pumping, helping save every precious drop. Best used with a snug-fitting nursing bra for a secure fit.</span>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\">𝐂𝐨𝐦𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐭𝐚𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐅𝐢𝐭: Made from soft, thickened silicone, the wide opening provides extra space around the nipple for enhanced comfort. The contoured shell gently follows the natural curve of the breast for a natural fit.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\">𝐐𝐮𝐢𝐜𝐤 𝐆𝐥𝐚𝐧𝐜𝐞, 𝐄𝐚𝐬𝐲 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐬𝐟𝐞𝐫: The transparent shell with clear volume markings lets you check milk at a glance. The wide, stable base keeps it upright between uses, and the smooth-pour spout ensures easy, spill-free transfer into storage bags.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\">𝐄𝐚𝐬𝐲 𝐭𝐨 𝐂𝐥𝐞𝐚𝐧: Rinse. Wash. Repeat. One-piece seamless interior with no nooks or crevices, designed for quick and easy cleaning. Suitable for hand washing or dishwasher use, and ready for reuse after each wash.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\">𝐏𝐞𝐚𝐜𝐞𝐟𝐮𝐥 𝐁𝐫𝐞𝐚𝐬𝐭𝐟𝐞𝐞𝐝𝐢𝐧𝐠: While you nurse on one side, it silently catches every letdown from the other. Made of food-grade, BPA-free silicone. One session, one bond, saving every drop.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-2-fullbackground-image aplus-premium\">\n<div class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\">\n<div class=\"a-section a-text-center\"> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<style type=\"text/css\">.aplus-v2 .apm-brand-story-carousel-container {\n        position: relative;\n    }\n\n    .aplus-v2 .apm-brand-story-carousel-hero-container,\n    .aplus-v2 .apm-brand-story-carousel-hero-container &gt; div {\n        position: absolute;\n        width: 100%;\n    }\n</style>\n<style type=\"text/css\">/*\n          Ensuring the carousel takes only the space it needs.\n          The sizes need to be set again on the absolutely positioned elements so they can take up space.\n        */\n        .aplus-v2 .apm-brand-story-carousel-container,\n        .aplus-v2 .apm-brand-story-carousel-hero-container {\n            height: 625px;\n            width: 100%;\n            max-width: 1464px;\n            margin-left: auto;\n            margin-right: auto;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        /*\n          This centers the carousel vertically on top of the hero image container and after the logo area (125px).\n          Margin-top = (heroHeight - cardHeight - logoAreaHeight) / 2 + logoAreaHeight\n        */\n        .aplus-v2 .apm-brand-story-carousel .a-carousel-row-inner{\n            margin-top: 149px;\n        }\n\n        /*\n          Cards need to have a width set, otherwise they default to 50px or so.\n          All cards must have the same width. The carousel will resize itself so all cards take the width of the largest card.\n          The left margin is for leaving a space between each card.\n        */\n        .aplus-v2 .apm-brand-story-carousel .a-carousel-card {\n            width: 362px;\n            margin-left: 30px !important;\n        }\n\n        /* styling the navigation buttons so they are taller, flush with the sides, and have a clean white background */\n        .aplus-v2 .apm-brand-story-carousel .a-carousel-col.a-carousel-left,\n        .aplus-v2 .apm-brand-story-carousel .a-carousel-col.a-carousel-right {\n            padding: 0px;\n        }\n\n        .aplus-v2 .apm-brand-story-carousel .a-carousel-col.a-carousel-left .a-button-image,\n        .aplus-v2 .apm-brand-story-carousel .a-carousel-col.a-carousel-right .a-button-image {\n            border: none;\n            margin: 0px;\n        }\n\n        .aplus-v2 .apm-brand-story-carousel .a-carousel-col.a-carousel-left .a-button-image .a-button-inner,\n        .aplus-v2 .apm-brand-story-carousel .a-carousel-col.a-carousel-right .a-button-image .a-button-inner {\n            background: #fff;\n            padding: 20px 6px;\n        }\n\n        .aplus-v2 .apm-brand-story-carousel .a-carousel-col.a-carousel-left .a-button-image .a-button-inner {\n            border-radius: 0px 4px 4px 0px;\n        }\n\n        .aplus-v2 .apm-brand-story-carousel .a-carousel-col.a-carousel-right .a-button-image .a-button-inner {\n            border-radius: 4px 0px 0px 4px;\n        }\n</style>\n<p><link href=\"https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/01cUckQOW-L.css?AUIClients/VSEPlayer\" rel=\"stylesheet\"> <link href=\"https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/51NP-5Gx4JL._RC|11knfgIR1IL.css_.css?AUIClients/Brila\" rel=\"stylesheet\"></p>", "vendor": "momcozy", "product_type": "Accessories", "created_at": "2024-09-19T22:21:28-04:00", "handle": "momcozy-breast-milk-collector", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:10-04:00", "published_at": "2024-09-19T22:21:28-04:00", "template_suffix": "bp-breast-milk-collector", "published_scope": "global", "tags": "Breastfeeding supplies, 储奶收集, 吸奶器, 吸奶器小品, 小品主链", "variants": [{"id": 44111440380102, "product_id": 8330798432454, "title": "2 Count", "price": "23.99", "sku": "BC009-NA71NB-A", "position": 1, "compare_at_price": "23.99", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_management": null, "option1": "2 Count", "option2": null, "option3": null, "created_at": "2024-09-19T22:21:29-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:10-04:00", "taxable": true, "barcode": "754912548029", "grams": 210, "image_id": 42791632535750, "weight": 0.2098, "weight_unit": "kg", "tax_code": "", "requires_shipping": true, "quantity_rule": {"min": 1, "max": null, "increment": 1}, "price_currency": "USD", "compare_at_price_currency": "USD", "quantity_price_breaks": []}, {"id": 44111440347334, "product_id": 8330798432454, "title": "1 Count", "price": "14.99", "sku": "BC009-NA